40	 * SCOPE: the join only. No tree is built, no `AgentNode`/`SessionState` is
41	 * emitted, and out-of-order live arrivals are not re-joined — that is the
42	 * Phase 2 stitcher. Everything here is a pure function of its input except the
43	 * one clearly-marked loader.
